        <body>
            <div xml:id="d591-a7">

                <pb facs="0565" n="491" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg491"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Paris</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-11">February 11,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Perry, Legation des Etats Unis, Madrid:</hi></p>
                <p>Has Niagara arrived? Has Stonewall sailed? Telegraph and write.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BIGELOW.</signed></closer>
            </div>
